{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD & Nessly]\n[00:08.46]Uh, uh, uh-uh, uh-uh, uh, uh (\n[00:11.14]Daytrip took it to ten, hey\n[00:13.90])\n[Verse 1]\n[00:13.96]Swallow all these pills with my pride (Uh)\n[00:16.66]Married to my highs, you may kiss the bride\n[00:20.34]Trouble in my brain, see it in my eyes\n[00:23.20]I got voices in my head, they keep me up at night\n[00:26.60]Said I was okay, but I'm lying, feel like that I'm dying\n[00:30.54]Soul screaming and crying, feel my brain frying\n[00:34.04]Try to numb the pain, all the drugs I've been buying\n[00:37.50]This oxy gettin' pricey, pour the codeine in the Hi-C\n[00:40.98]Blood red blend in the Hi-C\n[00:42.38]I've been doing so much wrong, even though ma told me to do the right thing\n[00:46.16]Poppin' pills all night long, in the studio pourin' out my feelings\n[00:49.60]Can't explain this feeling\n[00:51.36]Kinda feels like I'm losing even though I'm winning\n[Chorus]\n[00:56.62]Drain out bad energy (Drain out bad energy)\n[01:03.58]Forget the bad memories (Forget the bad memories)\n[01:10.54]Drain out bad energy (Drain out bad energy)\n[01:17.50]Forget the bad memories (Forget the bad memories, ayy, ayy)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:25.14]Multi-million dollars\n[01:28.00]All mine from the start\n[01:31.40]Codeine kills the drama\n[01:35.22]And the trauma in my heart\n[01:37.96]Just got a call from the dark side\n[01:39.16]Stab wounds in my chest, but I'm alright\n[01:40.96]I miss my friends, I hate this spotlight\n[01:42.70]I love my girl, I hate the thot life\n[01:44.50]Yellow diamonds, shiny pearls\n[01:46.16]I'm tryna give her the world\n[01:47.98]I'm tryna show her the world\n[01:49.44]She ain't no ordinary girl\n[01:51.82]I know she know, I know she know I'm down and out\n[01:55.14]Life is a ocean, demons I've been drownin' out\n[01:58.78]I watch the crowd and crack a smile\n[02:02.20]I have a job to lead them out\n[Chorus]\n[02:06.18]Drain out bad energy (Drain out bad energy)\n[02:13.16]Forget the bad memories (Forget the bad memories)\n[02:20.10]Drain out bad energy (Drain out bad energy)\n[02:27.08]Forget the bad memories (Forget the bad memories, drain, ayy)\n[Outro: Juice WRLD & Nessly]\n[02:49.92]Oh, oh, oh-oh, oh-oh (\n[03:00.00]Daytrip took it to ten, hey\n[03:01.06])\n[03:01.14]Oh, oh, oh-oh, oh-oh","words":[[8.46,8.8,"Uh,"],[9.62,9.7,"uh,"],[9.78,10.2,"uh-uh,"],[10.3,10.38,"uh-uh,"],[10.42,10.46,"uh,"],[10.9,10.98,"uh"],[11.0,11.02,"("],[11.14,13.24,"Daytrip"],[13.28,13.42,"took"],[13.54,13.6,"it"],[13.64,13.66,"to"],[13.76,13.8,"ten,"],[13.84,13.88,"hey"],[13.9,13.92,")"],[13.96,14.38,"Swallow"],[14.44,14.5,"all"],[14.66,14.82,"these"],[14.9,15.26,"pills"],[15.34,15.44,"with"],[15.48,15.64,"my"],[15.74,16.18,"pride"],[16.22,16.26,"(Uh)"],[16.66,17.0,"Married"],[17.08,17.14,"to"],[17.2,17.36,"my"],[17.48,18.18,"highs,"],[18.38,18.48,"you"],[18.56,18.66,"may"],[18.78,18.94,"kiss"],[19.0,19.08,"the"],[19.24,20.24,"bride"],[20.34,20.6,"Trouble"],[20.64,20.66,"in"],[20.7,20.84,"my"],[21.0,21.58,"brain,"],[21.84,22.12,"see"],[22.26,22.3,"it"],[22.36,22.42,"in"],[22.48,22.52,"my"],[22.62,23.14,"eyes"],[23.2,23.2,"I"],[23.3,23.46,"got"],[23.58,24.0,"voices"],[24.08,24.14,"in"],[24.2,24.36,"my"],[24.46,25.02,"head,"],[25.1,25.22,"they"],[25.3,25.5,"keep"],[25.58,25.64,"me"],[25.8,25.92,"up"],[26.0,26.02,"at"],[26.1,26.2,"night"],[26.6,26.72,"Said"],[26.8,26.8,"I"],[26.86,27.04,"was"],[27.14,27.42,"okay,"],[27.52,27.62,"but"],[27.7,27.82,"I'm"],[27.96,28.54,"lying,"],[28.78,28.96,"feel"],[29.02,29.18,"like"],[29.26,29.36,"that"],[29.44,29.5,"I'm"],[29.68,30.34,"dying"],[30.54,30.8,"Soul"],[30.9,31.24,"screaming"],[31.28,31.32,"and"],[31.36,32.04,"crying,"],[32.3,32.4,"feel"],[32.44,32.58,"my"],[32.68,33.0,"brain"],[33.1,33.92,"frying"],[34.04,34.24,"Try"],[34.28,34.34,"to"],[34.44,34.6,"numb"],[34.64,34.7,"the"],[34.9,35.26,"pain,"],[35.4,35.46,"all"],[35.52,35.6,"the"],[35.72,36.2,"drugs"],[36.28,36.36,"I've"],[36.4,36.52,"been"],[36.64,37.36,"buying"],[37.5,37.66,"This"],[37